module capability_discovery_followup_example

input capability_discovery_observation
input declaration_identity
input selected_capability
input external_boundary

status BOUND ask which declared capability or operation to inspect
status DEFERRED ask for an explicit external execution or authorization boundary
status UNKNOWN ask for the missing source, contract, query, declaration, or catalog term

field status
field questions
field first_boundary
field is_read_only

constraint deterministic_questions
constraint preserve_first_boundary
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_mutation
constraint no_permission_grant
